1
00:00:00,244 --> 00:00:01,859
Your AI agent can get sick.

2
00:00:02,049 --> 00:00:03,416
And there are four different ways it

3
00:00:03,228 --> 00:00:03,947
happens.

4
00:00:04,376 --> 00:00:04,788
One:

5
00:00:04,612 --> 00:00:05,237
input.

6
00:00:05,426 --> 00:00:07,748
An email or a website carries hidden

7
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,906
instructions, and the agent takes them as

8
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:10,378
orders.

9
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:11,177
Two:

10
00:00:11,036 --> 00:00:11,708
permission.

11
00:00:11,897 --> 00:00:13,595
It has more power than it needs.

12
00:00:13,795 --> 00:00:15,729
The model may fail, but the damage

13
00:00:15,541 --> 00:00:16,896
depends on how much you let it

14
00:00:16,708 --> 00:00:17,356
touch.

15
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:18,247
Three:

16
00:00:18,271 --> 00:00:19,002
objective.

17
00:00:19,191 --> 00:00:21,089
It meets the metric the wrong way:

18
00:00:21,302 --> 00:00:24,120
closing cases without solving them, or hiding

19
00:00:23,932 --> 00:00:24,816
exceptions.

20
00:00:25,268 --> 00:00:25,680
Four:

21
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,434
the network.

22
00:00:26,624 --> 00:00:29,229
A contaminated result passes from one agent

23
00:00:29,041 --> 00:00:31,022
to another, enters its memory…

24
00:00:31,105 --> 00:00:32,873
and comes back looking trustworthy.

25
00:00:33,288 --> 00:00:35,646
But watch out for an overreacting defense:

26
00:00:35,788 --> 00:00:37,710
it can take down healthy services too.

27
00:00:37,911 --> 00:00:39,443
That's digital autoimmunity.

28
00:00:39,856 --> 00:00:41,188
The cure is a cycle:

29
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:45,363
validate, authorize, observe, contain, and learn.

30
00:00:45,776 --> 00:00:47,780
Save it, and share it with anyone

31
00:00:47,592 --> 00:00:49,184
putting agents into production.

